#. fr: Chacun a son Vert à soi
#. column 2: Attain rank 7 reputation (sworn) with the Divine Circle.
msgctxt "Achievement:2000:0:1"
msgid "Divinity: Original Kojin"
msgstr "Божественность: истинный Кодзин"

